type: r

# missingmed — Missing-data causal mediation (R package, mediationverse)
# Scope decided 2026-06-04 (Data-Wise/missingmed#1): general CRAN-targeted toolkit —
# MI + IPW estimators, SEM + GLM models, MAR + MNAR sensitivity. S7-first.
# Thin orchestration layer: fit via medfit, infer via rmediation, simulate via medsim.

## Integration order: medfit ↔ missingmed (r-universe builds DEFAULT branches)
# The IPW path calls medfit::fit_mediation(weights=, se_type=), added on medfit
# feature/fit-weights. r-universe rebuilds each repo's DEFAULT branch and resolves
# medfit from the universe's own medfit build — so missingmed's universe build of the
# new code FAILS until medfit main carries the patch. DO IN THIS ORDER:
#   1. [done] medfit feature/fit-weights bumped to 0.3.1 (+ NEWS); this branch now
#      Imports medfit (>= 0.3.1) — a clean build fails LOUDLY if medfit is too old.
#   2. Merge medfit feature/fit-weights -> medfit main (PR), 0.3.1 + NEWS.
#   3. WAIT for the universe to actually serve it: poll
#      https://data-wise.r-universe.dev/api/packages/medfit until Version >= 0.3.1
#      (cron lag is ~hourly; do NOT merge missingmed before this shows green).
#   4. Then merge missingmed feature/s7-migration -> main, then feature/ipw-phase1.
#   5. Confirm at merge: missingmed Remotes = data-wise/medfit (default branch, NOT a
#      feature ref) so the universe builds from medfit main.
#   6. Verify: missingmed _status: success on the universe API before declaring done.
# medsim is NOT in this chain — PR #18 dropped missingmed/rmediation from its deps.

## Quick Notes
- 2026-06-11: Phase 0 S4->S7 migration IMPLEMENTED on feature/s7-migration (pushed,
  up to commit c4eb495; 11 commits, P0.1–P0.8 + 2 follow-ups). NOT yet merged to dev.
  - S7 classes MDMediationData/MDMediationFit/MDMediationResult; pipeline
    set_md_mediation() -> run() -> pool() -> infer(type=c("mc","mbco")).
  - run() delegates each imputation to medfit::fit_mediation() (named a/b/c_prime);
    pool() = Rubin's rules -> NAMED pooled medfit::MediationData (Open Q3 closed);
    per_imputation_list() accessor (#2 closed); D4-stacked MBCO HOSTED in missingmed
    (R/mbco_mi.R) — exact parity with research prototype (max abs diff 4.8e-11, 3 cells).
  - Namespace is RMediation (capital), NOT rmediation. medfit+RMediation in Imports.
  - S4 set_sem/run_sem/pool_sem .Deprecated() shims kept one cycle.
  - R CMD check E0/W0/N0; 47 tests pass; vignettes + _pkgdown.yml + pkgdown deploy wf.
  - Worktree: ~/.git-worktrees/missingmed/feature-s7-migration.
